<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;I used Text::CSV to read the data file, but AFAIK it doesn't support ignoring comment lines.
&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This works for me:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;code&gt;
csv (in =&gt; 'quux.csv', filter =&gt; {1 =&gt; sub { !/^#/ }});
&lt;/code&gt;</doctext>
